# CDISC-ODM fixtures

`cdisc_odm_data.xml` and `cdisc_odm_dictionary.csv` contain anonymized data
from the 3TR project (https://3tr-imi.eu/).

`generic_odm_v1.xml` and `generic_odm_v2.xml` are synthetic fixtures created
for Convert-Pheno. They exercise embedded ODM metadata, repeated item groups,
and the structural differences between ODM 1.3.2 and ODM 2.0.
